  "youtube": {
    "description": "it's 2001. the rain hasn't stopped, the city's empty and you're still in first place. 🏁\nY2K drum & bass in the spirit of Rollcage Stage II and the PS1 racing era: breakbeats, rolling bass and that late 90s / early 2000s game soundtrack energy.\n\nPut it on for driving, gaming, coding, studying or just staring out the window pretending you're in a loading screen.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTRACKLIST\n00:00 Ramp Transit\n01:55 Cold Downforce\n04:09 Electric Afterburn\n06:20 Final Turbo\n08:33 Hyper Traction\n10:47 Gearshift Line\n12:58 Lost Halogen\n15:10 Wet\n17:21 Hyper Signal\n19:33 Countersteer\n21:45 Underpass\n23:57 High Neon\n26:10 Afterglow Run\n28:24 High Midnight\n30:37 Lantern Transit\n32:49 Overpass\n34:59 Cipher Transit\n37:11 Static Transit\n39:23 Broken Kickdown\n41:34 Glow Theory\n43:48 Pulse\n46:01 High Inertia\n48:12 Reflex Approach\n50:24 Rain\n52:35 Nitro Stage\n54:46 Echo Line\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏎️ Visuals: Digital Aura Racing Team\n🎛️ Music: original tracks generated with custom Python scripts\n💿 Inspired by the sound of Rollcage Stage II and classic PS1 racers. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original game or its publishers.\n\nIf this takes you back, drop your favourite old racing game in the comments and subscribe for more Y2K DnB.\n\n#y2kdnb #drumandbass #ps1",
